+/*
+ * Copy at most one input buffer worth of data and push it.
+ *
+ * Returns the number of bytes consumed (>0), or a negative error code. The
+ * caller must keep feeding the remainder on later input buffers: OHCodec has
+ * no scatter-gather input, and silently truncating a slice corrupts the frame.
